      {
        "id": 215705,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-02T13:13:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"much0gust0\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n much0gust0:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This has dice!..in…the shape of a deck, haha ;)! It's actually much cleaner this way, as you can take out or add card (re: dice sides) to your deck (re: roll) to further upgrade your character. Super fun system.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nope.&nbsp; Do not want.</p>\n<p>Give me something like Shadows of Brimstone, which has a glorious handful of six-siders and a ton of character options for each class.</p>",
