        "created_at": "2018-04-02T22:15:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not to derail my own topic, but I was poking around on the website of the company that made Gloomhaven and <a href=\"http://www.cephalofair.com/2013/03/dungeon-hunters.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">it turns out that the designer loves SotM</a>&nbsp;and started work on a game (not Gloomhaven) that tries to achieve the same goals of simplicity and variance of gameplay as SotM.&nbsp; As near as I can tell, the game was never actually produced.</p>",
