        "created_at": "2018-04-02T22:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m conflicted about whether I’d want a Sentinels version of Gloomhaven. &nbsp; Primarily because there are few parts where I’m not sure it lines up very well, I’m not fully a fan of Legacy type games, and I don’t game as regularly. &nbsp;If something like it got made I’d be inclined to purchase it but it may not see play until my son is much older. &nbsp;</p>",
